WEBVTT

00:14.530 --> 00:16.780
Wh... Where...

00:16.780 --> 00:21.000
Where the hell am I?!

00:24.900 --> 00:27.290
A long time has passed.

00:27.290 --> 00:29.870
It is time to enter the third year of middle school.

00:29.870 --> 00:34.370
As if to signify the disturbance of the old and the new...

00:34.370 --> 00:37.180
...hundreds of flowers are falling.

00:37.180 --> 00:42.410
Thus begins the new comedy life of idiotic middle-schoolers.

00:48.480 --> 00:52.910
zettai da!! susume susume seishun da!!

00:48.480 --> 00:52.910
Absolutely! The youth will advance, advance!

00:53.110 --> 01:02.410
kui no nai you ni hareruya waraitai Yeah

00:53.110 --> 01:02.410
I want to laugh without regret, hallelujah, yeah!

01:07.090 --> 01:09.790
koi sae shiranai

01:07.090 --> 01:09.790
The uneasiness...

01:09.790 --> 01:12.380
kanojo no henka ni　

01:09.790 --> 01:12.380
...of the transformation of a girl,

01:12.580 --> 01:15.130
bimyuu na otome no　

01:12.580 --> 01:15.130
who doesn't even know love,

01:15.130 --> 01:17.390
mune sawagi　

01:15.130 --> 01:17.390
into a fair maiden.

01:17.720 --> 01:20.510
kokoro no kizuguchi (chiku chiku)

01:17.720 --> 01:20.510
Wounds of the heart (tingling)

01:20.510 --> 01:23.210
uwasa no torauma (kiri kiri)　

01:20.510 --> 01:23.210
Trauma of rumours (griping)

01:23.210 --> 01:25.810
jugyou no sukimite

01:23.210 --> 01:25.810
See the opportunities in class.

01:25.810 --> 01:28.650
shame ga kuru nan ja korya

01:25.810 --> 01:28.650
Someone has sent me a picture by phone... what's this!?

01:28.850 --> 01:31.460
minna ga raibaru

01:28.850 --> 01:31.250
We are all each other's rival.

01:31.460 --> 01:33.860
shocchyuu toraburu

01:31.460 --> 01:33.860
There is trouble all the time

01:33.860 --> 01:37.780
kono saki nani ga okoru no

01:33.860 --> 01:37.780
What will happen next?

01:37.780 --> 01:39.710
ittai zentai

01:37.780 --> 01:39.710
Now all as one!

01:40.450 --> 01:45.710
zettai da!! are yo kore yo souna no yo

01:40.450 --> 01:45.710
Definitely, it's like this and that!

01:45.710 --> 01:48.520
suki da to itte mo (shittemo)

01:45.710 --> 01:48.520
I all ready know you like me.

01:48.520 --> 01:51.240
abunagete (icchae yacchae)

01:48.520 --> 01:51.240
Even if you're scared, say it! Say it!

01:51.240 --> 01:55.800
zettai da! susume susume seishun da!!

01:51.240 --> 01:55.800
Absolutely! The youth will advance, advance!

01:55.800 --> 02:05.160
kui no nai you ni hareruya waraitai Yeah

01:55.800 --> 02:05.160
I want to laugh without regret, hallelujah, yeah!

02:29.460 --> 02:31.360
From today onwards, it's a new semester.

02:31.360 --> 02:33.610
We're all seniors now, right?

02:33.610 --> 02:35.090
Yeah, yeah...

02:35.380 --> 02:36.950
Seniors... Seniors...

02:36.950 --> 02:39.020
Why are you saying something so obvious?

02:39.020 --> 02:41.140
Lunar-chan, I'm surprised that you passed.

02:41.140 --> 02:44.290
Of course I would! What the hell are you talking about?!

02:44.290 --> 02:46.180
Something doesn't feel quite right about that.

02:47.890 --> 02:49.140
Disciplinary Committee

02:49.710 --> 02:50.340
Mawari!

02:50.340 --> 02:51.260
Mawari-chan!

02:51.260 --> 02:53.150
Good morning, seniors!

02:53.550 --> 02:54.770
G-Good morning.

02:54.770 --> 02:56.640
Good morning, Mawari, Class Rep.

02:56.640 --> 02:58.510
We're seniors!

02:58.510 --> 03:00.800
And you're late on the first day of a new semester!

03:00.800 --> 03:01.320
No...

03:01.320 --> 03:03.680
Mawari, the bell hasn't rung yet, so it's all righ-

03:03.680 --> 03:04.660
No excuses!

03:04.660 --> 03:09.450
It can't be helped. My manservant was sleeping like a pig.

03:09.450 --> 03:10.540
Lunar-chan, you're the one wh-

03:11.610 --> 03:13.960
You were sleeping, weren't you, pig?

03:13.960 --> 03:15.500
You're right, I was sleeping...

03:15.500 --> 03:18.420
You there! As responsible elder brothers and sisters,

03:16.050 --> 03:18.180
There was a pig...

03:18.420 --> 03:20.420
all of you are role models for your underclassmen.

03:20.420 --> 03:23.510
Shall I teach you the rules of society?

03:23.510 --> 03:25.130
Older sister, right?

03:25.130 --> 03:26.610
Midget!

03:26.610 --> 03:28.520
Whaaaaaat!

03:28.520 --> 03:31.320
It'd be great if we were all in the same class again.

03:31.320 --> 03:34.900
Y-You're right. That sure would be great...

03:34.900 --> 03:36.830
I feel like puking...

03:36.830 --> 03:41.740
Everyone, I got drunk while looking at flowers and fell asleep under a tree.

03:41.740 --> 03:47.290
Some young bastards came over looking for trouble, so I buried them under the sakura tree.

03:47.290 --> 03:51.250
Everyone, you're all seniors now, so don't do anything like that.

03:51.250 --> 03:53.690
All you have to do is study hard and keep up...

03:53.690 --> 03:55.200
...except Nagasumi-kun.

03:55.200 --> 03:57.670
Don't forget about me, guys!

03:57.670 --> 03:59.380
Father, what did you do?

04:00.920 --> 04:03.630
I'm sad too! I'm sad too!

04:03.630 --> 04:07.100
Nagasumi is the only one who went to a different class!

04:07.100 --> 04:10.600
You did that on purpose!

04:12.450 --> 04:15.030
Somehow... I seem to be in a bit of trouble...

04:15.030 --> 04:16.150
Hand it over, hand it over!

04:16.150 --> 04:18.810
A sandstorm is coming out of the television!

04:18.810 --> 04:20.390
Yes, yes, it's coming out.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.860
Wait, what is this place?

04:22.770 --> 04:24.360
That's a huge foot!

04:28.330 --> 04:30.520
Who is this Emperor-sama?

04:30.520 --> 04:32.290
And what's with those huge feet?

04:32.290 --> 04:34.550
Is Tenouzan-san really that unusual?

04:34.550 --> 04:36.720
Is it unusual that he comes to school?

04:36.720 --> 04:38.340
It's not unusual.

04:38.340 --> 04:39.740
Yo, a new face!

04:39.740 --> 04:41.710
What did you do then?

04:41.710 --> 04:42.090
Eh?

04:42.090 --> 04:46.160
This is the prison of Isono 8th Middle School, Class Zero.

04:46.160 --> 04:47.220
Class Zero?

04:47.220 --> 04:47.220
That's right.

04:47.500 --> 04:51.100
This place was made for delinquents like us!

04:51.100 --> 04:55.370
And Tenouzan-san has been the emperor of this class for many years!

04:55.370 --> 04:56.870
What do you mean, many years?!

04:56.870 --> 04:58.700
Grade doesn't matter!

04:58.700 --> 05:00.580
We're eternal middle schoolers!

05:00.580 --> 05:02.270
Eternal middle schoolers!

05:02.270 --> 05:04.480
Before long, I'll be able to shoot beams from my hands!

05:04.480 --> 05:06.360
That's frightening in so many ways...

05:06.360 --> 05:08.290
Yo, welcome to Class Zero.

05:08.290 --> 05:10.480
Let's be friends...

05:10.480 --> 05:12.650
What's with that uncontrollable shaking?

05:12.650 --> 05:15.620
You have two seconds to get me some yakisoba bread!

05:15.950 --> 05:19.500
Uh, our school doesn't sell yakisoba bread...

05:19.500 --> 05:21.270
Go to the convenience store!

05:21.270 --> 05:24.040
Fight! Believe in yourself a little more!

05:24.040 --> 05:26.830
Where's my yakisoba bread? Give it to me! Give it to me!

05:26.830 --> 05:29.230
I wonder if we'll be able to get along?

05:29.230 --> 05:31.550
Can you make 100 friends?

05:31.550 --> 05:33.640
All right, back to your seats.

05:36.030 --> 05:37.690
Class is starting.

05:37.690 --> 05:39.320
Crap, the teacher's here!

05:39.320 --> 05:40.690
Shark Fujishiro-san?!

05:40.690 --> 05:43.820
Bastard, are you the new homeroom teacher?

05:43.820 --> 05:47.280
But we're having compulsory education!

05:47.280 --> 05:49.660
So basically, we don't need you!

05:49.660 --> 05:51.950
It doesn't even matter if you <i>are</i> the teacher!

05:51.950 --> 05:54.200
We'll show you who's boss!

05:55.670 --> 05:57.470
Everyone, nice to meet you.

05:57.470 --> 05:58.920
I'm your homeroom teacher, Shark.

05:58.920 --> 05:59.960
As expected...

05:59.960 --> 06:02.890
It's my first time as a homeroom teacher,

06:02.890 --> 06:05.420
so I've studied quite a bit.

06:05.420 --> 06:07.930
Anyway, for today I want everyone to...

06:08.310 --> 06:10.180
...practise killing each other.

06:10.180 --> 06:12.350
What did you study?!

06:12.830 --> 06:15.560
Did everyone pick their seats randomly today?

06:15.960 --> 06:17.180
No, no, wait, wait...

06:17.180 --> 06:19.060
Somehow I feel like I was forced to sit in this seat.

06:19.420 --> 06:23.070
I've placed a weapon in each of your desks.

06:23.500 --> 06:26.070
The weapon you get will depend on your luck.

06:26.740 --> 06:28.240
This'll be tough if I don't get a good weap-

06:29.240 --> 06:30.950
Fish paste cake!

06:31.790 --> 06:34.200
I wonder if Nagasumi-san is all right...

06:34.200 --> 06:36.510
Where on earth did they take him?

06:36.510 --> 06:42.650
Since it's a new semester, let me introduce a new friend to everyone.

06:43.400 --> 06:44.920
Another transfer student?

06:44.920 --> 06:46.920
Hey, get in here.

06:49.970 --> 06:51.440
What's up!

06:51.440 --> 06:55.310
I'm the new transfer student, Lunar Papa-ko!

06:55.310 --> 06:56.980
Nice to meet you!

07:00.290 --> 07:01.830
A weirdo appeared!

07:01.830 --> 07:04.410
W-Weirdo, I'll arrest you this time!

07:04.410 --> 07:05.320
Papa...

07:05.320 --> 07:06.210
Huh? Papa?

07:06.210 --> 07:08.780
She said he shouldn't be underestimated.

07:08.780 --> 07:09.580
Right, right?

07:09.580 --> 07:10.950
Shouldn't be... underestimated...

07:10.950 --> 07:13.940
It's true, as usual he can't be underestimated...

07:13.940 --> 07:15.160
How troublesome.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.950
To think that he's trying to pass as a middle schooler, looking like that...

07:18.050 --> 07:21.280
So, you used dirty tricks to get into the class.

07:21.280 --> 07:23.710
You used tricks as well.

07:23.710 --> 07:27.210
Hurry up and take your seat!

07:27.210 --> 07:29.220
Nice to meet you, Lunar-chan!

07:29.220 --> 07:30.320
You...

07:30.320 --> 07:31.720
Beautiful hit!

07:31.720 --> 07:33.850
What sort of harassment is this?!

07:33.850 --> 07:36.220
I was told that Nagasumi-kun's seat was empty, so...

07:36.220 --> 07:38.730
Even if it's empty, why did you come?! Tell me!

07:38.730 --> 07:41.310
I wanted to cheer Lunar-chan up, since she was feeling lonely...

07:41.310 --> 07:42.630
Like that would cheer me up?!

07:42.630 --> 07:44.810
Why are you wearing a sailor uniform and an apron?!

07:44.810 --> 07:47.610
I thought you wanted some motherly love...

07:47.610 --> 07:51.240
I don't care if you cross dress, but don't come to my school like that!

07:51.240 --> 07:54.590
Hey, you there! You guys are being noisy during homeroom!

07:54.590 --> 07:57.430
Don't interrupt our family conversation.

07:57.430 --> 08:00.160
I'm telling you to not interrupt the class.

08:00.400 --> 08:02.370
Look who's talking.

08:02.370 --> 08:05.130
What did you say, you bastard?!

08:05.130 --> 08:06.630
Mama, I'm flying away~

08:06.630 --> 08:09.930
I feel disgusted just talking to you.

08:09.930 --> 08:12.470
After all, you are an enemy.

08:12.470 --> 08:15.510
It'll be bad if they start fighting in here!

08:15.510 --> 08:17.220
If we don't run away, we'll die...

08:17.220 --> 08:18.640
Zenigata, Class Rep!

08:19.890 --> 08:22.750
Everyone evacuate! Everyone evacuate!

08:22.750 --> 08:24.850
Everyone, leave the classroom in an orderly fashion.

08:24.850 --> 08:27.610
Stop them, San, Lunar!

08:27.610 --> 08:30.580
Where the hell did they go?!

08:31.110 --> 08:33.000
What the hell is with Lunar Papa?!

08:33.000 --> 08:35.740
We need to find my manservant and get him back into his seat!

08:35.740 --> 08:37.630
I want to find Nagasumi-san, too!

08:37.630 --> 08:40.790
I don't want to get involved in this madness!

08:40.790 --> 08:43.830
Nagasumi-san, I'm on my way!

08:44.320 --> 08:46.840
So, why am I surrounded?

08:46.840 --> 08:48.710
Nagasumi-kun, do your best.

08:48.710 --> 08:50.150
Of course I'll do my best!

08:50.150 --> 08:51.040
Class is starting now!

08:51.040 --> 08:54.040
Crush the weak one first!

08:54.040 --> 08:56.800
Roast meat set!

08:56.800 --> 08:59.680
The beginning of a holy war!

09:00.310 --> 09:02.520
Leave it to me. Maximum evade.

09:04.590 --> 09:05.660
H-He's...

09:05.660 --> 09:06.480
...fast!

09:06.810 --> 09:08.300
This is nothing. This is nothing.

09:08.300 --> 09:11.820
Compared to what San-chan's father did to me, this is...

09:12.130 --> 09:12.940
...nothing!

09:12.940 --> 09:13.960
What?

09:13.960 --> 09:15.320
He's flying!

09:15.320 --> 09:17.570
I... am... not... lazy!

09:19.340 --> 09:20.770
Nonsense.

09:20.770 --> 09:21.710
Tenouzan!

09:21.710 --> 09:23.830
Put "san" at the end, you damn fish paste cake bastard!

09:23.830 --> 09:25.920
The mountain, the mountain is moving!

09:25.920 --> 09:30.670
Even if it's you, you can't stop me in my current form!

09:31.880 --> 09:33.380
Freeze!

09:35.770 --> 09:38.490
Hey, what was that explosion just now?

09:38.490 --> 09:40.050
Nagasumi-san, are you in here?

09:43.280 --> 09:48.270
Nagasumi-san!

09:45.430 --> 09:48.270
Oh stars... I can see stars!

09:48.270 --> 09:50.820
Hey, hey, class is still in session.

09:50.820 --> 09:53.520
Fujishiro-san, what are you doing?!

09:53.520 --> 09:54.730
Just killing each other for a bit.

09:54.730 --> 09:58.450
I had my bodyguards come check things out, but where the hell are they?

09:58.450 --> 09:59.740
Stop them immediately!

09:59.740 --> 10:01.820
We won't allow anyone to interfere with the holy war!

10:01.820 --> 10:03.340
No mercy!

10:03.340 --> 10:05.000
Oh, girls, girls!

10:05.000 --> 10:07.070
What's with these people?

10:07.070 --> 10:08.710
Hey, everyone!

10:08.710 --> 10:10.020
Get them!

10:11.210 --> 10:13.950
Lu-Lunar-chan, you're making things worse!

10:13.950 --> 10:17.160
It's all for the purpose of saving my manservant, so show some gratitude!

10:17.720 --> 10:19.360
All right, you monsters!

10:19.360 --> 10:21.610
I'm going to sing the "Song of War" to power you up!

10:21.610 --> 10:22.850
Hey, Lunar-chan!

10:22.850 --> 10:26.480
One poem is enough for humans!

10:26.480 --> 10:28.410
Mermaid ancient lyrics,

10:28.410 --> 10:29.850
Song of War!

10:29.850 --> 10:33.110
Open your eyes, stand up ...

10:33.110 --> 10:35.260
Everyone, calm down!

10:35.260 --> 10:37.940
Mermaid ancient lyrics,

10:37.940 --> 10:39.360
Song of Sleep!

10:48.700 --> 10:50.070
I want to fight, but...

10:50.070 --> 10:51.350
...I feel so sleepy...

10:51.350 --> 10:53.380
Bring it on!

10:53.380 --> 10:54.830
No way...

10:54.830 --> 10:58.110
The Song of War should have more influence during a battle!

10:58.110 --> 10:59.530
I'm sleepy, too.

10:59.530 --> 11:03.100
Fujishiro-san, Lunar-chan... Everyone.

11:03.750 --> 11:07.450
You don't really want to kill each other...

11:07.450 --> 11:09.560
You're all merely afraid.

11:09.900 --> 11:14.070
Even if this is what you're told to do for class, there's no need to actually do it!

11:14.500 --> 11:17.490
If you guys lost your young lives for that reason,

11:17.490 --> 11:19.820
it would disgrace the name of the Seto mermaids!

11:20.190 --> 11:23.930
Write it as "Chivalry", but read it as "Mermaid"!

11:25.930 --> 11:26.820
We're...

11:26.820 --> 11:29.330
I see. So this is chivalry...

11:29.330 --> 11:32.960
Seriously, every single time.

11:32.960 --> 11:34.100
Retreat.

11:34.100 --> 11:34.680
Roger!

11:34.680 --> 11:35.750
Retreat!

11:36.670 --> 11:38.120
San-chan...

11:39.930 --> 11:41.290
You saved me.

11:41.290 --> 11:42.260
Thanks.

11:43.180 --> 11:44.990
Nagasumi-san.

11:44.990 --> 11:46.720
Little girl!

11:47.010 --> 11:50.310
How dare a woman interfere in a battle between men!

11:50.310 --> 11:52.230
Know your place.

11:52.230 --> 11:54.110
He still wants to fight?

11:54.110 --> 11:55.850
I am the emperor!

11:55.850 --> 11:58.710
Even if you're a woman, I won't show any mercy!

11:58.710 --> 12:00.610
San, watch out!

12:02.340 --> 12:03.740
Nagasumi-san.

12:03.740 --> 12:05.490
What? You...

12:05.870 --> 12:07.370
Nagasumi-san, are you all right?!

12:07.370 --> 12:08.910
Tenouzan.

12:08.910 --> 12:13.080
You bastard, what did you just try to do to San-chan?

12:13.080 --> 12:14.130
Manservant...

12:14.130 --> 12:17.630
Tell me... what you did!

12:17.630 --> 12:18.530
What?!

12:18.530 --> 12:19.630
Nagasumi-san!

12:19.950 --> 12:21.250
Oh, that is...

12:21.250 --> 12:22.850
No, no.

12:22.850 --> 12:25.550
That's just something like an after effect.

12:26.090 --> 12:30.270
A fist that hits women... won't work on me.

12:30.270 --> 12:33.520
Nonsense. I'm the emperor!

12:35.520 --> 12:37.440
With all of my might!

12:42.320 --> 12:43.830
Te-Tenouzan-san is...

12:43.830 --> 12:45.960
Tenouzan-san is on his knees!

12:45.960 --> 12:49.330
The emperor has... the emperor has...

12:50.590 --> 12:53.710
You must learn what love is, Tenouzan.

12:54.920 --> 12:56.670
My friend!

12:56.670 --> 12:58.630
Nagasumi-san...

12:58.630 --> 13:00.780
Wh-What an impressive counter!

13:00.780 --> 13:01.800
Akeno-chi?

13:02.170 --> 13:03.820
Perfect timing!

13:03.820 --> 13:08.810
No, what's more impressive is the valour of facing his punch head on and returning the blow!

13:08.810 --> 13:10.080
Hey...

13:10.080 --> 13:13.070
You were getting all lovey dovey over my manservant just now, weren't you?!

13:13.070 --> 13:14.820
Huh? There's no way-

13:14.820 --> 13:16.240
How troublesome.

13:17.420 --> 13:19.890
Akeno-chi, what about the classroom?

13:19.890 --> 13:21.710
About that...

13:23.440 --> 13:24.220
Papa!!!

13:24.220 --> 13:26.280
Father...

13:26.280 --> 13:28.780
I didn't manage to stop them.

13:28.780 --> 13:32.290
It didn't have any effect... Is this all you've got?

13:32.290 --> 13:35.290
Today I shall terminate you.

13:35.290 --> 13:36.950
Stop it...

13:36.950 --> 13:38.660
We need to stop them somehow...

13:38.660 --> 13:40.320
I will stop them.

13:40.320 --> 13:41.170
Nagasumi-san!

13:41.170 --> 13:43.670
Die, Edomae!

13:43.670 --> 13:45.680
This is <i>the end!</i>

13:49.360 --> 13:50.680
Fish paste cake!

13:52.340 --> 13:55.260
Nagasumi-san!

14:02.410 --> 14:03.970
A new semester...

14:03.970 --> 14:06.520
The sakura are blooming.

14:06.520 --> 14:10.140
But a single flower has fallen.

14:10.140 --> 14:11.550
Don't just kill me off here!

14:11.550 --> 14:12.600
I'm still alive!

14:12.600 --> 14:15.320
Nagasumi-san, you should remain still.

14:15.320 --> 14:16.960
Yes.

14:22.860 --> 14:27.040
Wearing this new jacket that I bought with all of my savings...

14:27.040 --> 14:28.570
Nagasumi-san.

14:29.440 --> 14:31.220
I'm going to watch a movie alone with San-chan today!

14:31.820 --> 14:33.220
In other words, a date!

14:33.220 --> 14:34.830
Yes, yes!

14:34.830 --> 14:37.600
Despite being married, we've never had a proper date before.

14:37.600 --> 14:38.830
What a sad story!

14:38.830 --> 14:40.340
Oh... A date for just the two of us...

14:40.340 --> 14:42.320
Thank you, thank you God!

14:42.320 --> 14:43.860
What's wrong, Nagasumi-san?

14:44.820 --> 14:45.810
Nothing.

14:45.810 --> 14:46.700
Umm...

14:46.700 --> 14:48.490
Two middle-schooler tickets.

14:48.490 --> 14:50.820
Also, one ticket for me.

14:50.820 --> 14:52.990
What?!

14:58.630 --> 14:59.950
Oh, Maki-chan!

14:59.950 --> 15:02.820
San-sama, Maki doesn't like being left behind!

15:02.820 --> 15:04.530
Ah, I'm sorry.

15:04.530 --> 15:05.970
Let's watch a movie together today.

15:05.970 --> 15:08.130
I'm so happy!

15:08.760 --> 15:10.540
Yo, Maki-chan...

15:10.540 --> 15:13.640
Yo, Sea Louse. It's a beautiful Sunday, isn't it?

15:13.640 --> 15:16.770
When did you get into my hood?

15:17.150 --> 15:19.900
Why do I have to tell you that?

15:19.900 --> 15:24.550
You...! What are you going do if somebody sees you?!

15:24.550 --> 15:26.400
I'll just kill them if that happens.

15:26.400 --> 15:28.300
You freaking death god!

15:28.300 --> 15:32.840
It's my job to interfere with your bad intentions!

15:32.840 --> 15:35.670
San-sama, what are you going to watch today?

15:35.670 --> 15:37.370
Mm, let's see...

15:37.370 --> 15:41.580
I've chosen a great movie to get San-chan in the mood...

15:41.580 --> 15:44.490
Excuse me, two tickets for "Love and Youth Bolero" please.

15:46.010 --> 15:47.770
That's the movie we're watching today?

15:47.770 --> 15:50.210
Yeah, that's what I planned...

15:51.100 --> 15:53.390
Chivalry Death 4!

15:51.720 --> 15:51.970
glances

15:55.300 --> 15:58.520
I wanted to watch "Love and Youth Boreo" too.

15:58.520 --> 15:59.850
Who's Boreo?

15:59.850 --> 16:02.190
Two tickets for "Chivalry Death 4" please.

16:02.190 --> 16:03.800
I'm sorry.

16:04.810 --> 16:06.660
Master, this way please.

16:06.660 --> 16:07.380
Yes.

16:07.380 --> 16:11.530
Two middle-schooler tickets for "Chivalry Death 4" please.

16:12.500 --> 16:14.770
Master, don't you want to watch "Chivalry Death 4"?

16:14.770 --> 16:15.660
Uh, well...

16:16.700 --> 16:19.410
Love and Youth Bolero.

16:19.770 --> 16:21.770
B-Bole...

16:21.770 --> 16:24.160
Two tickets for "Love and Youth Bolero" please.

16:24.160 --> 16:25.540
Oh, Saru!

16:30.510 --> 16:33.410
It's been a while since I've been to a cinema!

16:33.410 --> 16:35.760
Bunta-san's phone strap?!

16:35.760 --> 16:39.530
There are other Bunta-san items too!

16:39.530 --> 16:41.580
I even bought new clothes...

16:41.580 --> 16:43.020
Am I aiming for too much?

16:45.560 --> 16:46.390
Hey, kid!

16:46.390 --> 16:48.730
You dirtied my new jacket!

16:49.060 --> 16:51.260
Look who's talking! Were you even looking?

16:51.260 --> 16:52.860
What a waste of ice-cream.

16:53.550 --> 16:54.570
A girl?

16:54.570 --> 16:55.570
What about it?

16:55.570 --> 16:58.190
A little girl is going to watch "Chivalry Death 4"?

16:58.190 --> 17:00.460
Are you saying that I can't?!

17:00.460 --> 17:04.290
No, I'm just saying it's dangerous to run in the lobby.

17:04.290 --> 17:06.660
What if I was late and missed it because of that?

17:06.660 --> 17:10.210
My Bun-sama's "Chivalry Death 4" would begin without me!

17:11.710 --> 17:14.130
Miss, you're a fan of Bunta Willis?

17:14.540 --> 17:16.530
Onee-chan, you're a Bunta fan too?

17:16.530 --> 17:17.270
Yeah!

17:17.270 --> 17:19.170
Bun-chan is so cool!

17:19.170 --> 17:22.430
Even though he's a Hollywood star, he does the Chivalry movies too!

17:22.430 --> 17:24.020
Onee-chan, you get it!

17:24.550 --> 17:26.520
Since you're watching the dub version, you must be a real fan.

17:26.520 --> 17:28.910
The Hiroshima dialect sure is impressive.

17:28.910 --> 17:30.410
A bad start...

17:30.410 --> 17:32.890
Well, do your best, Sea Louse.

17:33.580 --> 17:35.330
I'm sorry, Nagasumi-san.

17:35.330 --> 17:36.530
I got carried away with the conversation.

17:37.060 --> 17:39.770
I was so happy, as I could talk to another female Bunta fan.

17:39.770 --> 17:41.190
Oh, it's fine.

17:41.190 --> 17:45.170
Nii-chan, I'll forgive you today because of that Onee-chan.

17:45.490 --> 17:47.160
Be careful next time.

17:47.160 --> 17:49.170
You damn brat...

17:51.560 --> 17:52.740
Damn it...

17:52.740 --> 17:56.180
It's been ages since I've had a holiday, and now this? Why am I always so unlucky?!

17:56.620 --> 18:00.930
Seriously, it looks like I have an unbreakable bond with chivalry.

18:02.360 --> 18:04.060
Bunta, watch out!

18:02.620 --> 18:05.970
That's why I said I hate-

18:07.520 --> 18:09.200
That guy is so unfair!

18:09.200 --> 18:11.370
San-chan, you should keep quiet during the movie.

18:11.370 --> 18:13.280
Sorry, I just...

18:13.570 --> 18:17.260
Since San-chan is having fun, I guess this is fine.

18:17.260 --> 18:21.200
I had different plans, but it's not cool to make a fuss.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.930
I'm sorr-

18:24.820 --> 18:29.130
You must stay quiet during the movie, Nagasumi-san.

18:29.130 --> 18:30.770
Ma-Ma-Ma-Ma...

18:30.770 --> 18:33.260
You'll disturb the other viewers.

18:33.260 --> 18:35.040
Why is Masa-san...?

18:35.040 --> 18:38.060
I'm a big fan of Bunta-san, too.

18:38.060 --> 18:39.590
But, I'm surprised.

18:40.370 --> 18:43.360
I would never have imagined I'd be sitting next to you, Nagasumi-san.

18:43.360 --> 18:45.970
This must be what they call fate.

18:45.970 --> 18:47.990
Fate...

18:47.990 --> 18:48.890
Wait, this is wrong!

18:48.890 --> 18:51.230
This is weird... I thought I got over this already!

18:51.230 --> 18:53.960
[Text: Real thing]

18:51.230 --> 18:53.960
This isn't real... This isn't real... This isn't real... This isn't real...

18:53.960 --> 18:55.610
This is the real deal!

18:56.760 --> 18:59.820
These are real C4 bombs.

19:00.140 --> 19:04.190
Oh, looks like we're at the good part, Nagasumi-san.

19:03.150 --> 19:04.580
Crap, I gotta run!

19:04.190 --> 19:04.580
Yeah.

19:06.400 --> 19:08.470
Explosions again...

19:08.470 --> 19:11.330
Do elementary school students enjoy watching this?

19:11.330 --> 19:14.000
Bunta! Behind! Behind!

19:14.000 --> 19:16.230
You bastards, die this time!

19:16.230 --> 19:17.720
Hey, you should be qui-

19:17.720 --> 19:18.510
Shut up!

19:20.030 --> 19:22.350
Show those villains what chivalry is!

19:22.350 --> 19:24.010
Miss.

19:26.490 --> 19:30.180
Miss, you should consider the other viewers too.

19:30.180 --> 19:33.030
Isn't that what chivalry is all about?

19:33.030 --> 19:35.400
You're right, I understand!

19:35.400 --> 19:40.350
Sea Louse, I thought you'd try to secretly hold San-sama's hand...

19:40.350 --> 19:42.750
...but it seems like you won't make it today.

19:42.750 --> 19:45.870
Well, I'll finish you off anyway. Take this.

19:47.510 --> 19:51.210
Go on ahead. I'll see you in hell, you bastards!

19:53.710 --> 19:55.570
The movie sure was interesting.

19:55.570 --> 20:00.000
Yeah... I wish I could cross the river. I like the beautiful village over there...

20:00.000 --> 20:01.760
Which scene was that?

20:01.760 --> 20:04.930
Thanks to that girl hitting me in the face...

20:05.810 --> 20:08.840
...my body is paralysed, and I can't move now.

20:08.840 --> 20:11.320
Nagasumi-san, it looks like that girl hates you.

20:11.320 --> 20:13.370
I hate her too.

20:13.370 --> 20:15.320
Were you waiting for me?

20:15.320 --> 20:17.260
Welcome back, Masa-san.

20:17.260 --> 20:19.310
That movie was quite astounding.

20:19.310 --> 20:22.910
The oil tanker smashing into the building was an impressive CG scene.

20:22.910 --> 20:23.860
Eh?!

20:23.860 --> 20:26.350
I thought they were all real!

20:26.350 --> 20:28.200
That's wrong, San-sama.

20:28.200 --> 20:30.770
Real ones look like... that!

20:30.770 --> 20:32.170
Wait a minute, why is a real-

20:32.560 --> 20:34.170
San-chan!

20:36.320 --> 20:37.940
A truck smashed into the cinema!

20:37.940 --> 20:39.870
Not just a truck... It's an oil tanker!

20:39.870 --> 20:40.830
Call the police!

20:40.830 --> 20:42.630
The driver was asleep!

20:42.930 --> 20:44.460
San-chan, are you all right?

20:44.460 --> 20:45.470
Miss!

20:48.530 --> 20:49.390
San-chan?

20:49.390 --> 20:52.490
Customers in the cinema, please follow the staff's instructions...

20:52.490 --> 20:54.400
Please head towards the emergency exit.

20:54.400 --> 20:56.020
What's happening, Saru?!

20:56.020 --> 20:57.900
It's shaking, Master!

20:57.900 --> 21:00.400
This way! Get away from the building!

21:01.490 --> 21:04.070
Pull yourself together, Driver-san!

21:04.070 --> 21:04.900
San-chan!

21:04.900 --> 21:06.320
Nagasumi-san?

21:06.320 --> 21:07.280
I'll help.

21:07.280 --> 21:09.290
Are there any wounded?

21:09.290 --> 21:10.900
Is anyone injured?

21:10.900 --> 21:12.410
Here!

21:12.410 --> 21:13.550
Miss!

21:13.550 --> 21:14.770
Is he wounded?

21:14.770 --> 21:17.210
I don't know, but he's the driver.

21:17.210 --> 21:18.650
Is anyone else wounded?

21:18.650 --> 21:20.710
San-chan is amazing.

21:20.710 --> 21:24.630
Even at times like these, she stayed calm and tried to help out.

21:25.450 --> 21:26.730
The fire is spreading!

21:26.730 --> 21:28.090
Let's leave, Mistress San.

21:28.090 --> 21:30.260
Let's leave it to the pros. We should-

21:30.260 --> 21:31.390
That girl...

21:31.960 --> 21:33.750
That elementary student girl!

21:33.750 --> 21:35.650
She said she wanted to go to the toilet, then we got separated!

21:36.010 --> 21:39.570
We promised to meet up later, but...

21:39.570 --> 21:40.650
Could it be...

21:41.650 --> 21:42.900
Over there!

21:42.900 --> 21:43.550
No way!

21:43.550 --> 21:44.650
We left her behind?!

21:44.650 --> 21:46.490
What a thing to happen...

21:46.490 --> 21:48.140
You guys, you need to leave!

21:48.140 --> 21:51.410
Please wait, there's still a girl on the 7th floor!

21:51.870 --> 21:54.910
If we go in now, the rescue team will also be in danger!

21:54.910 --> 21:57.640
The oil truck may also explode...

21:57.640 --> 22:00.200
We're trying to extinguish the fire from a safe distance.

22:00.200 --> 22:02.550
But what if you don't make it in time?!

22:04.760 --> 22:06.430
Rescue that girl!

22:06.860 --> 22:07.880
Calm down.

22:07.880 --> 22:10.440
Please, we can still make it!

22:10.440 --> 22:11.400
Damn it...

22:11.400 --> 22:13.990
If you won't go and rescue her, I'll-

22:13.990 --> 22:15.190
Nagasumi-san!

22:15.530 --> 22:16.400
Dammit!

22:16.400 --> 22:17.190
Wait!

22:20.180 --> 22:21.900
What the hell am I doing?!

22:22.990 --> 22:24.610
But if it was San-chan,

22:24.610 --> 22:27.570
she would've gone to rescue her even if we tried to stop her.

22:27.570 --> 22:30.740
I don't know if this is the right thing to do, but...

22:31.330 --> 22:34.150
But doing this... doing this is...

22:34.780 --> 22:38.630
This is chivalry!

22:38.630 --> 22:40.990
I'm here to rescue you, damn brat.

22:40.990 --> 22:42.380
I'm not a damn brat!

22:42.380 --> 22:43.680
What are you doing?!

22:43.680 --> 22:45.080
Everyone has already evacuated!

22:45.080 --> 22:48.770
I was waiting for the elevator to get here!

22:48.770 --> 22:49.620
Saru!

22:49.620 --> 22:50.870
Master!

22:50.870 --> 22:52.850
I didn't think the elevator would stop!

22:52.850 --> 22:54.980
Why were you in the restroom for so long?!

22:54.980 --> 22:57.230
Because I was holding it in for the entire movie!

22:57.230 --> 22:59.380
Why did you buy such a large bottle of juice!?

22:59.380 --> 23:01.310
Because the booth was doing a promotion!

23:01.310 --> 23:02.360
Master, you're an idiot!

23:02.360 --> 23:03.610
Saru, you fool!

23:08.090 --> 23:09.660
It really doesn't work...

23:09.660 --> 23:10.470
It won't move!

23:10.470 --> 23:11.860
That's what I told you!

23:11.860 --> 23:14.530
It sounds like something below us just collapsed...

23:15.080 --> 23:17.030
We probably shouldn't use the stairs.

23:17.030 --> 23:20.130
How are we supposed to get down without using the stairs?!

23:20.600 --> 23:22.380
I'm thinking about it now!

23:22.380 --> 23:24.150
Think about that before you come rescue me!

23:24.150 --> 23:24.980
Shut up!

23:24.980 --> 23:26.880
Try to understand the situation we're in, you damn brat!

23:41.720 --> 23:43.010
Are you hurt?

23:43.010 --> 23:44.360
What about you?

23:45.890 --> 23:48.360
That was nothing compared to what usually happens to me.

23:48.360 --> 23:49.720
No, no!

23:49.720 --> 23:50.970
If you were going to say something,

23:50.970 --> 23:55.230
say "Damn... Why am I always so unlucky?", or something like that!

23:55.230 --> 23:56.000
What is that?

23:56.000 --> 23:59.000
It's a line that Bunta Willis said in the movie before!

23:59.000 --> 24:00.760
She's so annoying!

24:00.760 --> 24:01.940
Maki, you were here?!

24:01.940 --> 24:04.940
Fool, this isn't the time to be talking about that kinda crap.

24:04.940 --> 24:06.760
The building isn't going to hold!

24:12.500 --> 24:14.600
Damn, it's falling apart!

24:14.600 --> 24:16.800
Hey, what are we going to do?!

24:16.800 --> 24:20.100
We can't use the elevator or stairs, and the building is collapsing.

24:20.100 --> 24:22.100
We can't escape anymore!

24:22.100 --> 24:23.520
Don't worry.

24:23.520 --> 24:25.320
We can use this rope to escape through the window.

24:25.320 --> 24:27.870
Through the window... you mean that window?

24:27.870 --> 24:29.900
We can't do something like that!

24:29.900 --> 24:35.710
Hey, hey... In a big pinch, with nowhere left to run...

24:35.710 --> 24:37.450
...does Bunta Willis give up?

24:38.630 --> 24:40.210
Now you've said it, Sea Louse.

24:40.580 --> 24:42.050
He wouldn't give up!

24:42.050 --> 24:46.710
He'd just smoke and complain about his wife, while planning to escape!

24:47.150 --> 24:49.100
Don't say such rude things.

24:49.100 --> 24:53.180
I'm on good terms with my wife.

24:54.070 --> 24:55.090
No way...

24:55.090 --> 24:56.180
The floor collapsed...

24:57.510 --> 25:00.180
Is this the end?

25:00.670 --> 25:03.060
Mermaid ancient lyric,

25:03.060 --> 25:04.690
Song of Heroes!

25:05.270 --> 25:06.190
San-chan!

25:06.610 --> 25:11.190
I hope my feelings get through and reach him!

25:11.620 --> 25:14.820
Come back, Nagasumi-san!

25:16.330 --> 25:22.040
Master, a storm... A storm has come!

25:22.960 --> 25:25.340
San-chan!

25:26.500 --> 25:28.230
Nagasumi-san!

25:28.230 --> 25:29.210
Those kids jumped out of the building!

25:29.210 --> 25:30.460
Sea Louse!

25:30.830 --> 25:32.090
Take this, Maki!

25:32.090 --> 25:34.840
Jetstream attack!

25:48.420 --> 25:51.880
I'm back... San-chan.

25:53.010 --> 25:55.820
Welcome back, Nagasumi-san.

25:55.820 --> 25:57.430
Jeez, what are you doing?!

25:57.430 --> 25:57.980
Huh?!

25:57.980 --> 25:59.870
Hey, this is the important part!

25:59.870 --> 26:03.140
You need to end it with a cool line!

26:03.140 --> 26:05.850
You chivalry movie maniac...

26:05.850 --> 26:11.030
Seriously... It looks like I have an unbreakable bond with chivalry.

26:19.010 --> 26:21.980
Man, I'm beat after that movie...

26:21.980 --> 26:22.880
Here.

26:23.930 --> 26:26.960
The firemen scolded me.

26:27.470 --> 26:28.940
You must be cold after getting wet, right?

26:28.940 --> 26:30.690
This isn't wet inside.

26:30.690 --> 26:34.510
Seriously, you scared me, Nagasumi-san.

26:34.510 --> 26:35.280
Masa-san...

26:35.690 --> 26:36.650
Don't do such-

26:36.650 --> 26:39.940
That's right! Don't do such dangerous things alone ever again!

26:39.940 --> 26:41.540
San-chan, what's wrong?

26:41.540 --> 26:44.450
Jeez, don't you know how worried I was?!

26:45.660 --> 26:46.960
San-chan...

26:47.570 --> 26:50.590
Jeez... you idiot.

26:50.590 --> 26:54.130
Ah... I'm sorry.

26:55.380 --> 26:58.630
Well then, it's about time for us to go home.

26:58.630 --> 27:00.760
See you, be careful on your way back home.

27:01.700 --> 27:06.520
A mere Sea Louse, you're 10 years too early to order me about!

27:06.520 --> 27:09.310
But I'll let you go for today.

27:10.000 --> 27:12.770
So that guy's name is Nagasumi.

27:13.170 --> 27:15.480
Nagasumi Willis!

27:29.330 --> 27:32.900
nayamashii sekai o sukueru nani ka

27:29.330 --> 27:32.900
Something that could save this complex world.

27:34.330 --> 27:38.100
kizutsuite wakaru kokoro no parusu

27:34.330 --> 27:38.100
The pulse of my injured heart...

27:38.100 --> 27:40.820
kesshite naite naru mono ka

27:38.100 --> 27:40.820
...is definitely not something to cry about.

27:40.820 --> 27:44.820
ruuru kara hamidasu abunai doko ka

27:40.820 --> 27:44.820
Somewhere where danger flows out of the rules.

27:45.810 --> 27:49.620
butsukatte sagasu nakama no sain

27:45.810 --> 27:49.620
Look for signs of your friends.

27:49.620 --> 27:51.730
seigi koso hitotsu

27:49.620 --> 27:51.730
If it's really, really true,

27:51.730 --> 27:55.440
dame na yatsu nante honto wa

27:51.730 --> 27:55.440
that there is no such thing...

27:55.440 --> 27:57.830
inai inai hazu naraba

27:55.440 --> 27:57.830
...as a really useless person,

27:57.830 --> 28:03.250
ase to namida soko kara nani ga aru

27:57.830 --> 28:03.250
Something will come out of all that sweat and tears.

28:03.250 --> 28:06.500
ganbatte ikite mirun da

28:03.250 --> 28:06.500
I'm doing my best to get everything out of life,

28:06.500 --> 28:09.390
donna kabe ga arouto

28:06.500 --> 28:09.390
no matter what obstacles there are.

28:09.390 --> 28:14.830
ashita wa mada nani mo kimatte nai

28:09.390 --> 28:14.830
Tomorrow isn't decided yet.

28:14.830 --> 28:18.000
taiyou wa miteite kureru

28:14.830 --> 28:18.000
The sun is looking over me.

28:18.000 --> 28:20.940
tsuki mo shinjite kureru

28:18.000 --> 28:20.940
The moon believes in me.

28:20.940 --> 28:28.340
yareru koto o yume to yobebaii mirai he Go

28:20.940 --> 28:28.340
On to the future where we can do the things we dream about! Go!

28:44.950 --> 28:46.650
There were no deaths as a result of this incident.

28:46.650 --> 28:48.350
Only the driver was wounded.

28:48.350 --> 28:50.230
As for the cinema, it was...

28:50.230 --> 28:53.260
Man, today was a bad day.

28:53.260 --> 28:55.130
I can't believe Onii-chan was at that cinema too.

28:55.130 --> 28:57.430
We both had it rough today.

28:58.780 --> 29:01.010
So, how was Chivalry Death 4?

29:01.010 --> 29:03.470
I saw a super manly man!

29:03.830 --> 29:05.620
That's great!

29:07.470 --> 29:09.930
The End!

29:09.930 --> 29:11.640
Is serving people Shiranui's new secret?

29:11.640 --> 29:12.720
Working in a maid costume?

29:12.720 --> 29:13.690
Wait, wait, what is she planning to do?

29:13.690 --> 29:14.680
Or is she hiding something?

29:14.680 --> 29:15.280
This is troublesome!

29:15.280 --> 29:16.940
Do San-chan and the others have to participate too?

29:16.940 --> 29:18.030
Is this the friendship between women?

29:18.030 --> 29:20.940
Parental love, sibling love, a place with all sorts of love.

29:20.940 --> 29:23.770
A new leisure spot in Saitama, the Mermaid Café.

29:23.770 --> 29:24.950
You'll come.

29:24.950 --> 29:27.610
On a hot night... the unstoppable rain...

29:27.610 --> 29:29.320
A study session with just the two of us...

29:29.320 --> 29:30.930
Our family will not return...

29:30.930 --> 29:33.090
The truth is hidden in the rumours.

29:33.090 --> 29:36.440
What will happen if you fall for it?

29:36.440 --> 29:38.880
I am Satan, and I am right...

29:38.920 --> 29:39.960
...behind you.
